WEBVTT

00:00:59.964 --> 00:01:01.114
torture.

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:04.337
The US government
says it doesn't use torture,

00:01:04.361 --> 00:01:07.101
and we condemn other countries,
like Iran and North Korea,

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:08.792
for their use of torture.

00:01:09.496 --> 00:01:13.410
But some people think the so-called
worst of the worst deserve it:

00:01:13.434 --> 00:01:17.355
terrorists, mass murderers,
the really "bad" people.

00:01:18.071 --> 00:01:20.969
Now I personally believe
that no one deserves to be tortured

00:01:20.993 --> 00:01:22.317
by the US government.

00:01:22.341 --> 00:01:23.599
But that's me.

00:01:23.623 --> 00:01:30.623
(Applause)